sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as Operator Workstation<br/>rhaii-validator CLI
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant NS as rhaii-validation<br/>Namespace
    participant Job as Probe Job<br/>(GPU Node)
    participant Host as Host Devices<br/>/sys/class/*

    Note over Operator: Phase 1 - Cleanup & Setup
    Operator->>KubeAPI: DELETE prior rhaii-validation namespace<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: Namespace deleted (if existed)

    Operator->>KubeAPI: CREATE Namespace rhaii-validation
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: Namespace created

    Operator->>KubeAPI: CREATE ServiceAccount rhaii-validator
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: SA created

    Operator->>KubeAPI: CREATE ClusterRole rhaii-validator<br/>(empty rules - SCC subject only)
    Operator->>KubeAPI: CREATE ClusterRoleBinding<br/>SCC: privileged
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: RBAC provisioned

    Note over Operator: Phase 2 - Deploy Probe Jobs
    Operator->>KubeAPI: CREATE Job (gpu-check / rdma-check / etc.)<br/>nodeSelector: GPU nodes<br/>SA: rhaii-validator (privileged SCC)
    KubeAPI->>Job: Schedule on GPU node

    Note over Job: Phase 3 - Agent Execution
    Job->>Host: Read GPU driver version, ECC status<br/>via /sys/class/drm, nvidia-smi
    Host-->>Job: GPU health data
    Job->>Host: Read RDMA devices, NIC status<br/>via /sys/class/infiniband
    Host-->>Job: RDMA/IB device data
    Job->>Host: PCI topology scan<br/>GPU-NIC affinity
    Host-->>Job: Topology data

    Note over Job: Phase 4 - Result Collection
    Job->>KubeAPI: CREATE ConfigMap (mesh results)<br/>namespace: rhaii-validation
    Job-->>Job: Write results to stdout

    Note over Operator: Phase 5 - Collect & Report
    Operator->>KubeAPI: GET Pod logs (Job results)<br/>via Kubernetes log API
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: stdout results
    Operator->>KubeAPI: GET ConfigMaps (mesh topology)<br/>namespace: rhaii-validation
    KubeAPI-->>Operator: ConfigMap data

    Note over Operator: Validation report generated
